$ mcpdial catalog
exit 0
--- stdout
Docs and search
  remote  Acme Remote  http   none     The fake server, from the registry

Databases
  box     Acme Box     stdio  env      A sandbox, as a Python package

Local files
  files   Acme Files   stdio  env      Serve one directory; the entry leaves the directory to the user
  fake    Fake         http   none     The fake server, by its URL
--- stderr

add one with: mcpdial add NAME --catalog ID
